From a7f266d1c2a3418040919eed53ad4bae666ce4c5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yang Tsao <yang@fydeos.io>
Date: Wed, 8 Apr 2026 14:49:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 14/40] Add NV12 GPU shader, notification metadata key, TaskId
 propagation
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- GLESRenderEngine: NV12/YCbCr_420_888 GPU composition via per-plane
  EGL dmabuf import and custom Y+UV→RGBA shader. Enables camera preview
  through WaylandTaskOutput's CLIENT composition path.
- LayerMetadata: add METADATA_NOTIFICATION_KEY for notification surfaces
- SurfaceFlinger: register notification metadata key in genericLayerMetadataKeyMap
- Layer: propagate TaskId metadata to child layers so SurfaceView
  descendants inherit the parent task's TaskId for per-task composition

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
